flowchart TD
  A[QA creates batch status QUARANTINE] --> B[Storekeeper goods receipt]
  B --> C[(QUARANTINE pool RECEIPT plus QUARANTINE_IN)]
  B -.-> AP[GoodsReceived to Accounting AP]
  C --> D{QC record result}
  D -- PASS or CONDITIONAL --> E[QA release]
  D -- FAIL --> F[QA reject]
  E --> G[(WAREHOUSE pool sellable)]
  F --> H[(DAMAGED pool no exit path)]
  G --> I[Sales saga reserve request]
  CS[(Customer consignment)] --> J
  I --> J[FEFO allocate consignment first then warehouse]
  J --> K{Enough stock}
  K -- no --> L[Release all lines and StockReservationFailed]
  K -- yes --> M[Reservation OPEN]
  M --> N[Ship order assertShippable]
  N --> O[ISSUE onHand minus q reserved minus q no COGS]
  M --> P[Cancel order release]
  M --> Q[Stale over 72h report only]
  B2[Second receipt of released batch] --> C2[(stays in QUARANTINE until manual move)]
